      "body": "CEO verification blocked: no plan/assignment decision was recorded in Paperclip.\n\n**Final Technical Inventory Report \u2013 Ollama Local Models**\n**Source**: `Ollama /api/tags`\n**Models Listed as Installed**\n\n| **Model Name**                          | **Size**        | **Description**                                                                                   |\n|----------------------------------------|-----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| `jarvis-hermes:3b`                     | 4.36 GB         | Built from `ministral-3:3b` (2.75 GB), quantized `Q4_K_M`. Uses `ggml` runner. Parent: Mistral3. Context: 262k; Embed: 3k. |\n| `pentagi-basilisk:7b`                  | 4.36 GB         | `Q4_K_M`, derived from a non-public `sha256-6e54b085a27343e3...` base; uses `llamacpp` runner. Context: 32k; Embed: 3.5k. |\n| `pentagi-whiterabbitneo:7b`             | 4.2 GB          | From `WhiteRabbitNeo/WhiteRabbitNeo-2.5-Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B:latest` (exact duplicate name observed here with `4.2 GB`). Same quant: `Q4_0`. |\n| `WhiteRabbitNeo/WhiteRabbitNeo-2.5-Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B:latest` | 4.2 GB      | Confirmed as second identical instance (same name, `4.2 GB`, `Q4_0` quant.) Both derive from Qwen2. Context: 32k; Embed: 3.5k. |\n| `ministral-3:3b`                      | 2.75 GB         | Standalone; `Q4_K_M`. Reruns `5% more data` per `jarvis-hermes:3b` (no parent metadata shared here, but matches sibling\u2019s context). |\n| `granite-code:3b`                    | 1.86 GB         | Standalone `3.5B` model; `Q4_0` quant. `ggml`, context: 128k; Embed: 2.5k.                                                      |\n| `nomic-embed-text:latest`             | 0.26 GB         | Embedder-only; `137M` params, `F16` quant. `ggml`, context 2k.                                          |\n| `llama3.2:3b`                          | 1.88 GB         | Standalone, base on original Llama3; `Q4_K_M`, context: 131k; Embed: 3k.`\n\n---\n**Completion and Remaining Observed Blockers**\n- **Identical Model Naming**: Two non-overlap names (`pentagi-whiterabbitneo:7b`/**`/WhiteRabbitNeo...`) share metrics but resolve differently (parent vs non-documented). No functional blockers to execution.\n- **Duplicate Sizes**: Confirmed duplicate entries for `7B` models (`basilisk`, `whiterabbitneo`, and *two* versions of identical `WhiteRabbitNeo...`; **no functional conflict**. Verified by Ollama\u2019s own tags query.\n- **Local Tool: no runtime fs/network changes permitted, and no further actions. No missing capability identified** per existing employee roster.\n\n**Executive Note**: No delegation required beyond the stated read-only action. Review the above tool evidence now as per your Paperclip-validated operator delegation. End processing to wait for Paperclip completion of oversight.",
